<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>AI for Lawyers | Register Now</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700;900&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --navy: #0d1b2a;
      --gold: #c9a84c;
      --gold-light: #e8c97a;
      --cream: #f5f0e8;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --text-muted: #6b7280;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--cream);
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ── Background texture ── */
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 70% 10%, rgba(201,168,76,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 10% 80%, rgba(201,168,76,0.05) 0%, transparent 55%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    /* ── Thin gold rule at top ── */
    .top-bar {
      width: 100%;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
    }

    /* ── Nav ── */
    nav {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1.8rem 2rem;
    }
    .logo {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    /* ── Hero ── */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 5rem 2rem 3rem;
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease both;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.35);
      padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5.2rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.05;
      color: var(--white);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    h1 em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--gold-light);
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.75);
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto 3rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* ── CTA button ── */
    .cta-wrap {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.9rem;
      animation: fadeUp 0.9s 0.2s ease both;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--gold);
      color: var(--navy);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 1.1rem 3rem;
      border-radius: 3px;
      transition: background 0.25s, transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.25s;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(201,168,76,0.25);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: var(--gold-light);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(201,168,76,0.35);
    }
    .cta-note {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.45);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    /* ── Divider ── */
    .divider {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 4rem auto;
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }
    .divider::before, .divider::after {
      content: '';
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
    }
    .divider-icon {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    /* ── What you'll learn ── */
    .section {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 2rem 5rem;
      animation: fadeUp 0.9s 0.35s ease both;
    }
    .section-label {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--white);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .section-sub {
      text-align: center;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.5);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .modules {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    .module-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.15);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
      transition: border-color 0.25s, background 0.25s;
    }
    .module-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(201,168,76,0.4);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }
    .module-num {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
    .module-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--white);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .module-desc {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.55);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* ── Instructor strip ── */
    .instructor {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      background: rgba(201,168,76,0.06);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.15);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.15);
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      animation: fadeUp 0.9s 0.45s ease both;
    }
    .instructor p {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.7);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }
    .instructor strong {
      color: var(--gold-light);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* ── Bottom CTA ── */
    .bottom-cta {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 5rem 2rem 4rem;
      animation: fadeUp 0.9s 0.55s ease both;
    }
    .bottom-cta h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
      color: var(--white);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .bottom-cta p {
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.55);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    footer {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1.5rem 2rem 2.5rem;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.25);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    /* ── Animation ── */
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero { padding-top: 3rem; }
      .modules { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="top-bar"></div>

  <nav>
    <span class="logo">MyShingle.com</span>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Now Enrolling</span>
    <h1>AI for <em>Lawyers</em></h1>
    <p class="subtitle">A practical, hands-on training program that shows you exactly how to use AI in your law practice — without the hype, without the guesswork.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="cta-wrap">
    <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScchvVMEva4cwzoS5sCeCAKAXGghV5qHPxA3ct2o6asRzcR3w/viewform?usp=header" class="btn-primary">Register for the Class</a>
    <span class="cta-note">Spots are limited — secure yours today</span>
  </div>

  <div class="divider">
    <span class="divider-icon">✦</span>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">What You'll Learn</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Practical skills you can use the same week</p>
    <div class="modules">
      <div class="module-card">
        <div class="module-num">Session 01</div>
        <div class="module-title">Getting Started with AI</div>
        <p class="module-desc">Understand the AI landscape, choose the right tools for your practice, and set up your workspace securely.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="module-card">
        <div class="module-num">Session 02</div>
        <div class="module-title">AI for Legal Research & Drafting</div>
        <p class="module-desc">Use AI to accelerate research, draft briefs, contracts, and correspondence — faster and with greater precision.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="module-card">
        <div class="module-num">Session 03</div>
        <div class="module-title">Building Your AI Workflow</div>
        <p class="module-desc">Create custom skills and repeatable systems so AI works for your specific practice area, every day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="instructor">
    <p>Taught by <strong>Carolyn Elefant</strong> — founder of MyShingle.com, energy &amp; appellate attorney, and one of the earliest voices training lawyers on AI since November 2022. She's done the work so you don't have to figure it out alone.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom-cta">
    <h2>Ready to get started?</h2>
    <p>Join attorneys already using AI to work smarter and serve clients better.</p>
    <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScchvVMEva4cwzoS5sCeCAKAXGghV5qHPxA3ct2o6asRzcR3w/viewform?usp=header" class="btn-primary">Register Now</a>
  </div>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 MyShingle.com &nbsp;·&nbsp; carolyn@myshingle.com
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
